    "measurementTechnique": [
      "Some of the surveys have been performed with a Mala system while others with a sensor and sensor & software system. Some of the transects have been collected two times in both directions (see duplicates in file name and date). The reflectors have been picked and the travel time adjusted based on airwave travel time. A constant velocity for each media (incl., snow, soil) have been used to obtain depth from travel time."
